Article 3

The objectives of protecting women and children from acts of violence are: a. to prevent all forms of violence against women and children; b. to provide protection and services to women and child victims of gender-based violence;

c. to provide a sense of security to women and child victims of violence; d. to restore the physical, psychological and economic condition of women and child victims of violence;

e. best interests of women and child victims of violence that occur in the domestic and/or public sphere; and

f. to take action against perpetrators of violence against women and children.

